   "resume_nature": "Fifteen years of atmospheric CO 2 measurements show that the Amazon carbon sink is weakening, with fires, deforestation and climate stress driving increasingly high carbon emissions.",
   "vignette": "https://media.springernature.com/w290h158/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41586-026-11168-1/MediaObjects/41586_2026_11168_Fig1_HTML.png",
